"Nierna secretly serves the Aleph Grid against her own Ashen Accord."
"Years later, when she swears by Deiman before the Ostren war, Khachi senses her betrayal."
"She leaks the Accord's battle plans to the Aleph Grid and tries to poison Nathan Lark."
"After the war Kaelis beheads her for treason and casts her out of the Ashen Accord."
